  "body": "Character, Space & An Exceptional Coastal Lifestyle\r\n\r\nSome properties are simply houses. Others offer an opportunity to secure a lifestyle in a location people aspire to call home.\r\nWelcome to 13 Cameron Street, Takapuna.\r\nPositioned in one of Auckland's most sought-after North Shore suburbs, this appealing four-bedroom residence combines established character, generous space and the wonderful lifestyle that makes Takapuna so desirable.\r\nSet on a substantial 519m² freehold section, the property offers room to enjoy, space to grow and an opportunity to make a home your own.\r\n\r\nA LOCATION THAT SPEAKS FOR ITSELF\r\n\r\nImagine enjoying morning walks along Takapuna Beach, coffee at your favourite local café, boutique shopping, excellent restaurants and the convenience of everything this vibrant coastal community has to offer.\r\nTakapuna delivers an enviable balance of coastal relaxation, urban convenience and established neighbourhood appeal.\r\n\r\nSPACE, CHARACTER & OPPORTUNITY\r\n\r\nWith four bedrooms and two bathrooms, there is flexibility for families, professionals, guests or those simply wanting additional room to enjoy.\r\nThe established setting and generous landholding add to the appeal, offering a property with genuine lifestyle potential in a highly desirable location.\r\nWhether you are looking for your next family home, a coastal retreat or an opportunity to secure a foothold in Takapuna, this property deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nDON'T LET THIS OPPORTUNITY PASS YOU BY\r\n\r\nThe owners are motivated to achieve a sale and are ready to consider genuine offers.\r\nIf Takapuna is on your wish list, now is the time to arrange your viewing and discover what 13 Cameron Street has to offer.\r\n\r\n13 CAMERON STREET, TAKAPUNA - Your next chapter could start here.\r\n\r\nContact Lewis Guy at New Zealand Sotheby's International Realty for more information or to arrange a private inspection.",
